      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Falls_Mills%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A Norfolk and Western Railroad dam across Mud Fork Creek creates a lake over a mile long, twenty feet high.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
